msgctxt "#31516"
msgid "A full-screen wall of posters for films and series. Pick it with VIEW: POSTER WALL in the library header; the other views and their defaults are untouched."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#31517"
msgid "Up from the top row shows the header. Back leaves the view."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#31518"
msgid "Small: 11 posters across (12 with no gap). Medium: 8. Large: 6. Posters are never cropped; the next row peeks in at the bottom of the screen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#31519"
msgid "Gap: a strip of page between posters (16 px, 24 px at Large). No gap: posters edge to edge, with square corners."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#31520"
msgid "On: the accent line around the selected poster (inside its edge when there is no gap). Off: the selected poster zooms slightly and the others dim."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#31521"
msgid "After you rest on a poster for 1 or 2 seconds, a card with the title, times, plot and media details covers the posters beside it. Any button press hides it at once."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#31522"
msgid "Colour, corners, focus outline and the artwork behind the page. Changes apply at once; changing the corners reloads the skin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#31523"
msgid "Up / Down picks a category, Right enters it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#31524"
msgid "What sits under the spotlight on Home, and how often the spotlight moves on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#31525"
msgid "Motion, and a way back to the defaults."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#31526"
msgid "One colour marks where you are: the focus outline, the active menu item, unwatched markers, progress bars and the Play button."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#31527"
msgid "Left / Right picks a colour. Text on the accent is always near-black, so every option stays readable."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#31528"
msgid "Square or slightly rounded (8 px) corners on posters, album covers, episode thumbnails and buttons."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#31529"
msgid "Changing it reloads the skin, which takes a second."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#31530"
msgid "The stroke around the selected poster. Off keeps the zoom, so focus never disappears; lists, buttons and dialogs always keep their frame."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#31531"
msgid "Needs TMDb Helper, which isn't enabled, so the artwork background stays off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#31532"
msgid "A heavily blurred copy of the spotlighted or selected film's poster sits behind the page at low opacity."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#31533"
msgid "Made once per film by TMDb Helper from a small thumbnail, then cached. It waits until you stop scrolling, so browsing never slows down. Off uses nothing at all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#31534"
msgid "Shows a Trailer button next to Play and Details on Home and the info page. It only appears when the film has a trailer link; playback goes through the YouTube add-on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#31535"
msgid "Unwatched: a small accent square. Watched: a check tab. TV shows add the unwatched count and a progress bar. Keep either, both or none."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#31536"
msgid "Where the subtitle and audio offset strip appears while you sync. Top keeps bottom-aligned subtitles in view; pick Bottom if your subtitles sit at the top of the screen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#31537"
msgid "Date added: films in the order they arrived. Release date: newest premieres first. Both: two rows, date added first."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#31538"
msgid "How long the playback controls stay up after your last button press. They stay while paused and while a menu is open."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#31539"
msgid "How often the spotlight moves to the next film. It pauses while focus is on Play, Details or Trailer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#31540"
msgid "Replaces zooms and slides with short fades. Focus changes stay instant."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#31541"
msgid "Puts every Majan setting back to its default and reloads the skin. Press OK twice to confirm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#31542"
msgid "Majan's own options. Kodi's settings live under Settings; switch skins in Settings > Interface > Skin."
msgstr ""

